# The build context is the repository root (both Dockerfiles say what they copy), so keep out
# everything an image must not contain: history, dependencies built on another platform, build
# output, the planning notes, tests and anything that may hold a credential.
.git
.claude
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfplan
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra
docs
examples
scripts
test
packages/*/test
packages/*/e2e
docker-compose.test.yml
